<title>SWEDEN: Cargo traffic at Swedish airports up 10 pct Oct.</title>
<headline>Cargo traffic at Swedish airports up 10 pct Oct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish airports handled 10 percent more cargo in October than in October 1995, altogether 15,511 tonnes, the Swedish civil aviation administration Luftfartsverket said on Friday.</p>
<p>					 SWEDISH AIRPORT ACTIVITY</p>
<p>					   Oct		Jan-Oct</p>
<p>				    1996     1995     1996    1995</p>
<p> Cargo(in tonnes)	   15,511   14,063   123,050   109,980</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)	    2,829    2,865    25,906    21,985</p>
<p> Landings		     29,594   28,434   282,391   274,637</p>
<p> Passengers (in millions)   1.64     1.54     14.94     14.11</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
